Subject: How to define adjacency matrix when there is an exclave island
Message-ID: <uWveQEHfkT8.EYTThy1OAAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/uWveQEHfkT8/m/EYTThy1OAAAJ>
