Subject: question about the functioning of buildLaplace
Message-ID: <69byAolqNAo.mGNZndEBAQAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/69byAolqNAo/m/mGNZndEBAQAJ>
